  language: 1
  dialogues:
  - You okay <color=#FF00FF>Sonny</color>? I heard some crazy noises over there.
  - I was about to come down and help! <shake>(COF, COF)</shake>.\nThough I never
    doubted the <color=#FF00FF>Guardian of the Order</color> would manage by himself.
  - I see you extracted the power from that hideous thing. With it you can reach
    the training grounds, to my left.
  - I'm sure you'll have a lot of fun! <shear>hehehe</shear>.
